											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-circle"></i>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text text-justify"><span style="font-weight:600;">Water: </span>The quality of water should be like drinking water and should be free from all sorts of impurities.</span>
